message: "If you use this software, model, or experimental artifacts in research, please cite this repository."
title: "Fire & Smoke Detection R3-E6"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Prammano"
    given-names: "Supakorn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Supakorn289/fire-smoke-detection-r3e6"
url: "https://github.com/Supakorn289/fire-smoke-detection-r3e6/releases/tag/v1.0.1"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-09-25
abstract: >-
  End-to-end research software and model-development archive for a YOLOv8s
  fire and smoke detector. The repository documents dataset exploration,
  FASDD curation and leakage control, architecture comparison, hard-negative
  mining, R2/R2.1/R3 refinement, pre-test model freeze, a locked final test,
  ONNX export, equivalence validation, CPU benchmarking, and release artifacts.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - object detection
  - fire detection
  - smoke detection
  - YOLOv8
  - hard-negative mining
  - PyTorch
  - ONNX
  - research software
